  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.02 Recipient Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.02 Recipient Eligibility. All recipients shall be eligible for telehealth services when:\n\n(a) Telehealth, including teledentistry, is determined medically necessary pursuant to He-W 530.01(e); and\n\n(b) The recipient has consented to using telehealth, including teledentistry, as a method of receiving services.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c5000.html"
}
